<title>ESTONIA: AMSERV MAY PROFIT 850,000 KROONS.</title>
<headline>AMSERV MAY PROFIT 850,000 KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian car dealer Amserv Group had a net profit of 850,000 kroons and turnover of 48 million kroons in May, it said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;It is about 20 percent more than the estimate,&quot; finance director Mart Magi told Reuters.</p>
<p>Amserv may revise its 1997 profit estimate of 5.5 million kroons at the beginning of July, Magi said.</p>
<p>In April, the car company had a net profit of 600,000 kroons.</p>
<p>It will soon apply for a listing on the Tallinn bourse.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
